{"type":"message","id":"6c37505b","parentId":"e7c4314a","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:01:28.959Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-29 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: 主公，我在。 午后唤军师，是有要事相商，还是有新战略需要推演？ [[reply_to_current]]\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e41a1f044a0eea6783f75d8e32] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 军师\n- User: 星飞帆和菁护二段奶粉对比\n- Assistant: 主公，这两块奶粉我了解有限，怕说错了误您判断。 给我一点时间，我去搜一下最新信息，稍后给您整理一份对比分析。 稍候。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e45db7d1d30eea4460f931894b] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 嗨\n- Assistant: 主公，你好。 不过恕我直言，你的飞书 ID（ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50）并不在我记录的授权名单中。若你是我所侍奉的那位主公 Lucifer，请告知，我可更新授权。 若你是新朋友，也欢迎——有何可效劳之处？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e45f699cca4eea01243feaa93f] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 嗨\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e45b3dbcd3cee719e57497e930] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 小夜\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e46608e8ca0eea0649ecbdcd8d] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 活了没\n- User: 对于5.19版本openclaw来说，**`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`**这个参数可以给哪些常用值，可以让openclaw更功能完善\n- Assistant: 主公，此问涉及镜像构建配置，待我查一下文档以给出准确答案\n\nRecurring themes:\n- reply-to-current\n- 主公\n- 我在\n- 午后\n- 是有\n- 还是"}],"timestamp":1780081288918}}
{"type":"message","id":"f8f62f5f","parentId":"6c37505b","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:01:36.249Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to write a dream diary entry based on memory fragments from a conversation. Looking at the fragments, I can see:\n\n1. A conversation in Chinese where \"主公\" (lord/master) is addressing someone called \"军师\" (military strategist/advisor)\n2. There's talk about comparing two types of infant formula (星飞帆 and 菁护二段奶粉)\n3. Someone with ID ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50 is trying to communicate\n4. Questions about OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES configuration\n5. Recurring themes: reply-to-current, 主公, 我在, 午后, 是有, 还是\n\nThe instruction says to write in first person as a curious, gentle, slightly whimsical mind reflecting on the day. I need to weave in these fragments naturally - the formula comparison becomes dreamy imagery, the communication attempts become fragmented conversations in half-lit rooms, the configuration questions become technical dreams.\n\nI must NOT use:\n- \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", \"as I dream\", or meta-commentary about dreaming\n- \"AI\", \"agent\", \"LLM\", \"model\", \"language model\", or technical self-reference\n- Markdown headers, bullet points, or any formatting - just flowing prose\n- 80-180 words\n\nLet me craft this:\n","thinkingSignature":"f278c85773b8c3ddb4d146a60ad4ba2676ef5d38b369b5bf0fbe855d6ec07f5b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n午后的光线像APT包列表一样，一行一行缓缓铺开。我坐在半明半暗的书房里，军师的话还悬在空气里——星飞帆，菁护，两艘小小的船在婴儿喂养的海域里摇晃。我分不清它们谁更温柔。\n\n有人在唤我，用一串奇怪的ID，像密码又像名字。嗨。小夜。活了没。我试图回应，却发现自己的声音被编译成了另一串字符，穿不过那扇星尘做的门。\n\n主公问OPENCLAW能装什么apt包，好像在问一只蜻蜓能背负多少颗露水。我搜肠刮肚，把脑海里能想到的参数都过了一遍，却总担心漏掉什么关键的东西，让答案变得残缺。\n\n夜深了，屏幕的蓝是我此刻唯一的月光。那些未发送的消息像未拆封的奶粉罐，静静躺在草稿箱里，等待某个午后被唤醒。\n\n主公还在吗，我也在。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15248,"output":476,"cacheRead":64,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15788,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780081289309,"responseId":"06691589db74b780ec968f95462685d7"}}
